Package: skylight
Title: Family Calendar Display with AI Chat
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Wade", , "github@jameshwade.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A beautiful, always-on calendar display app for iPad with Google
    Calendar integration and AI-powered natural language interaction. Built with
    Shiny, bslib, and ellmer for a modern, reactive experience.
